        <div class="model-layer open" onclick="toggleLayer(this)"><div class="model-layer-hd"><div class="ml-icon must"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M3 15h18M9 3v18"/></svg></div><div class="ml-info"><div class="ml-name">乡村运营 SOP 框架</div><div class="ml-desc">团队自有标准操作流程 · 验证核心</div></div><span class="ml-badge must">必须内置</span><span class="ml-arrow">▾</span></div><div class="model-layer-body"><div class="ml-items"><div class="ml-item"><div class="ml-item-name">社区基础调研</div><div class="ml-item-desc">人口结构、经济来源、土地权属</div></div><div class="ml-item"><div class="ml-item-name">文化资产盘点</div><div class="ml-item-desc">非遗、传统技艺、节庆、口述历史</div></div><div class="ml-item"><div class="ml-item-name">利益相关方分析</div><div class="ml-item-desc">村委、村民、外来资本、政府</div></div><div class="ml-item"><div class="ml-item-name">业态可行性评估</div><div class="ml-item-desc">资源匹配度、市场需求、启动门槛</div></div><div class="ml-item"><div class="ml-item-name">风险识别</div><div class="ml-item-desc">政策风险、社区矛盾、资金缺口</div></div><div class="ml-item"><div class="ml-item-name">行动路径规划</div><div class="ml-item-desc">短期切入点、中期目标、长期愿景</div></div></div></div></div>
        <div class="model-layer" onclick="toggleLayer(this)"><div class="model-layer-hd"><div class="ml-icon verify"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div><div class="ml-info"><div class="ml-name">材料验证层</div><div class="ml-desc">哪块认知被支撑，哪块被推翻</div></div><span class="ml-badge verify">核心机制</span><span class="ml-arrow">▾</span></div><div class="model-layer-body"><div style="padding-top:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;"><div class="verify-block ok"><div class="verify-block-title">材料支撑的认知（3条）</div><div class="verify-block-body">· 山歌传承危机真实存在，传承人平均年龄 68 岁<br>· 土地流转矛盾是当前最主要经济矛盾<br>· 外出务工是主要收入来源，但村民有返乡意愿</div></div><div class="verify-block pending"><div class="verify-block-title">待验证的假设（2条）</div><div class="verify-block-body">· 村民对文旅业态的参与意愿<br>· 外来资本进入的可能性与条件</div></div><div class="verify-block fail"><div class="verify-block-title">被推翻的预设（1条）</div><div class="verify-block-body">· 村民对旅游业的抵触程度高于预期（原预设：村民普遍欢迎旅游开发）</div></div></div></div></div>
        <div class="model-layer" onclick="toggleLayer(this)"><div class="model-layer-hd"><div class="ml-icon opt"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/></svg></div><div class="ml-info"><div class="ml-name">学术框架层（可选 Skill）</div><div class="ml-desc">费孝通等框架作为参考视角，非强制</div></div><span class="ml-badge opt">可选</span><span class="ml-arrow">▾</span></div><div class="model-layer-body"><div class="ml-items"><div class="ml-item"><div class="ml-item-name">费孝通·乡土中国</div><div class="ml-item-desc">差序格局、礼治秩序、血缘地缘</div></div><div class="ml-item"><div class="ml-item-name">项飙·附近的消失</div><div class="ml-item-desc">社区感知、流动性、在地认同</div></div><div class="ml-item"><div class="ml-item-name">景军·神堂记忆</div><div class="ml-item-desc">集体记忆、文化复兴、社区动员</div></div></div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-hd"><div class="card-title"><div class="card-icon a1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div>SOP 完成度</div></div><div class="card-body" style="padding:12px 14px;"><div class="prog-list"><div class="prog-item"><div class="prog-hd"><span class="prog-name">社区基础调研</span><span class="prog-val">92%</span></div><div class="prog-track"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:92%;background:var(--a2);"></div></div></div><div class="prog-item"><div class="prog-hd"><span class="prog-name">文化资产盘点</span><span class="prog-val">78%</span></div><div class="prog-track"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:78%;background:var(--a1);"></div></div></div><div class="prog-item"><div class="prog-hd"><span class="prog-name">利益相关方分析</span><span class="prog-val">65%</span></div><div class="prog-track"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:65%;background:var(--a5);"></div></div></div><div class="prog-item"><div class="prog-hd"><span class="prog-name">业态可行性评估</span><span class="prog-val">71%</span></div><div class="prog-track"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:71%;background:var(--a2);"></div></div></div><div class="prog-item"><div class="prog-hd"><span class="prog-name">风险识别</span><span class="prog-val">45%</span></div><div class="prog-track"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:45%;background:var(--a3);"></div></div></div><div class="prog-item"><div class="prog-hd"><span class="prog-name">行动路径规划</span><span class="prog-val">30%</span></div><div class="prog-track"><div class="prog-fill" style="width:30%;background:var(--a1);"></div></div></div></div></div></div>
        <div class="ai-box"><div class="ai-box-hd"><span class="ai-badge">AI 建议</span><span class="ai-box-title">下一步行动</span></div><div class="ai-body" style="font-size:10px;">当前 SOP 完成度 <strong>63%</strong>，风险识别和行动路径规划是最薄弱环节。<br><br>建议补充：<strong>村民对旅游业态的深度访谈</strong>（可验证 2 条待验证假设），预计需要 3—5 次访谈。</div></div>
