          <div class="tl-entry-hd"><span class="tl-entry-date">2024-03-18</span><span class="tl-entry-type audio">音频</span><span class="tl-entry-title">村民访谈_王大爷</span><span class="tag-green" style="margin-left:auto;">已完成</span></div>
          <div class="tl-entry-body">王大爷（72岁，布依族山歌传承人）深度访谈。核心内容：山歌传承现状、年轻人学习意愿、六月六节庆变化。提炼关键词 12 个，时间码精确定位 3 处。</div>
          <div class="tl-entry-kws"><span class="tl-kw">布依族山歌</span><span class="tl-kw g">传承危机</span><span class="tl-kw s">六月六</span><span class="tl-kw">老龄化</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-entry doc">
          <div class="tl-entry-hd"><span class="tl-entry-date">2024-03-16</span><span class="tl-entry-type doc">笔记</span><span class="tl-entry-title">土地流转现状调研笔记</span><span class="tag-green" style="margin-left:auto;">已完成</span></div>
          <div class="tl-entry-body">系统梳理村庄土地流转历史（2021—2024），记录 12 户农户的流转情况、收益变化及矛盾点。3,200 字，提炼关键词 6 个。</div>
          <div class="tl-entry-kws"><span class="tl-kw">土地流转</span><span class="tl-kw g">农户矛盾</span><span class="tl-kw">村集体经济</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-entry event" onclick="openTimelineDetail('event', '村委会提出申请山歌非遗保护', '2024-01-15', '事件 · 关键节点')" style="cursor:pointer;">
          <div class="tl-entry-hd"><span class="tl-entry-date">2024-01-15</span><span class="tl-entry-type event">事件</span><span class="tl-entry-title">村委会提出申请山歌非遗保护</span><span class="tag-sand" style="margin-left:auto;">关键节点</span></div>
          <div class="tl-entry-body">村委会正式讨论并通过申请布依族山歌非物质文化遗产保护的决议，委托文化局协助整理材料。这是山歌传承从民间自发走向制度保护的转折点。</div>
          <div class="tl-entry-kws"><span class="tl-kw">布依族山歌</span><span class="tl-kw g">非遗保护</span><span class="tl-kw s">政策制度</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2023 -->
      <div class="tl-group">
        <div class="tl-group-label">2023 年 · 田野调研启动期</div>
        <div class="tl-entry audio">
          <div class="tl-entry-hd"><span class="tl-entry-date">2023-11-08</span><span class="tl-entry-type audio">音频</span><span class="tl-entry-title">蜡染工艺传承人访谈</span><span class="tag-green" style="margin-left:auto;">已完成</span></div>
          <div class="tl-entry-body">对村内 3 位蜡染工艺传承人（平均年龄 64 岁）进行深度访谈。记录完整工艺流程、传承困境、市场需求现状。时长 52 分钟，提炼关键词 15 个。</div>
          <div class="tl-entry-kws"><span class="tl-kw">蜡染工艺</span><span class="tl-kw g">手工艺传承</span><span class="tl-kw s">文化资产</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-entry event">
          <div class="tl-entry-hd"><span class="tl-entry-date">2023-11-02</span><span class="tl-entry-type event">事件</span><span class="tl-entry-title">土地流转价格重新谈判</span><span class="tag-sand" style="margin-left:auto;">关键节点</span></div>
          <div class="tl-entry-body">村委会与流转方重新谈判，将流转价格从 600 元/亩/年提高至 800 元/亩/年。部分农户仍不满意，提出以土地入股的诉求。</div>
          <div class="tl-entry-kws"><span class="tl-kw">土地流转</span><span class="tl-kw g">村集体经济</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-entry video">
          <div class="tl-entry-hd"><span class="tl-entry-date">2023-06-12</span><span class="tl-entry-type video">视频</span><span class="tl-entry-title">传统节庆活动记录_六月六</span><span class="tag-green" style="margin-left:auto;">已完成</span></div>
          <div class="tl-entry-body">完整记录布依族六月六节庆活动，包含山歌对唱、蜡染展示、传统饮食制作。时长 45 分钟，提炼关键词 11 个。参与者以 50 岁以上村民为主，青年参与率约 15%。</div>
          <div class="tl-entry-kws"><span class="tl-kw">布依族山歌</span><span class="tl-kw g">传统节庆</span><span class="tl-kw s">蜡染工艺</span><span class="tl-kw">老龄化</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-entry video">
          <div class="tl-entry-hd"><span class="tl-entry-date">2023-03-20</span><span class="tl-entry-type video">视频</span><span class="tl-entry-title">山歌表演现场记录_布依族</span><span class="tag-green" style="margin-left:auto;">已完成</span></div>
          <div class="tl-entry-body">春季山歌表演活动现场记录，王大爷等 4 位传承人演唱传统布依族山歌。时长 28 分钟，提炼关键词 8 个。重点时间码：00:03:20—00:09:45（核心演唱段落）。</div>
          <div class="tl-entry-kws"><span class="tl-kw">布依族山歌</span><span class="tl-kw g">民族文化</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2022 -->
      <div class="tl-group">
        <div class="tl-group-label">2022 年 · 背景资料期</div>
        <div class="tl-entry event">
          <div class="tl-entry-hd"><span class="tl-entry-date">2022-08-15</span><span class="tl-entry-type event">事件</span><span class="tl-entry-title">土地流转矛盾激化</span><span class="tag-sand" style="margin-left:auto;">关键节点</span></div>
          <div class="tl-entry-body">部分农户反映流转收益低于预期，与流转方产生纠纷。村委会介入调解，但矛盾未完全化解。这是后续重新谈判的直接导火索。</div>
          <div class="tl-entry-kws"><span class="tl-kw">土地流转</span><span class="tl-kw g">农户矛盾</span></div>
