        <div class="report-cover-sub">基于 47 份多模态材料（音频 23 份、视频 12 份、文字笔记 8 份、表格 4 份）的系统性分析，涵盖文化传承、经济生产、社会结构三大维度。</div>
        <div class="report-cover-meta">
          <div class="report-cover-meta-item"><strong>2024-03-20</strong>报告生成日期</div>
          <div class="report-cover-meta-item"><strong>47 份</strong>材料总数</div>
          <div class="report-cover-meta-item"><strong>128 个</strong>提炼关键词</div>
          <div class="report-cover-meta-item"><strong>6 项</strong>业态推演</div>
