                <div class="sub-vein-kws"><span class="sub-vein-kw">外出务工</span><span class="sub-vein-kw g">返乡意愿</span><span class="sub-vein-kw s">空心化</span></div>
                <div class="sub-vein-desc">约60%青壮年外出务工，汇款占家庭收入65%。短期稳定但长期导致村庄空心化，部分青年有返乡意愿。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="sub-vein-expand">
              <div class="sub-vein-expand-body"><strong>双重性：</strong>外出务工既是村庄经济的主要支柱，也是村庄活力流失的主要原因。这一矛盾在短期内难以改变，但可以通过业态孵化为有返乡意愿的青年提供经济替代方案。</div>
              <div class="vein-reports"><div class="vein-reports-title">关联报告</div><div class="vein-report-links"><div class="vein-report-link r3" onclick="goToReport('r3',event)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>三度报告 · 返乡创业路径</div></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sub-vein-card" onclick="toggleSubVein(this)">
            <div class="sub-vein-hd">
              <div class="sub-vein-icon a3"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3h18v18H3z"/><path d="M3 9h18M3 15h18M9 3v18"/></svg></div>
              <div class="sub-vein-info">
                <div class="sub-vein-name">传统农业转型</div>
                <div class="sub-vein-kws"><span class="sub-vein-kw">山地农业</span><span class="sub-vein-kw g">有机农业</span><span class="sub-vein-kw s">农耕体验</span></div>
                <div class="sub-vein-desc">水稻玉米为主，机械化程度低。有机认证和农耕体验是两个可探索的转型方向。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="sub-vein-expand">
              <div class="sub-vein-expand-body"><strong>转型潜力：</strong>贵州山地农产品具备天然的有机属性，但缺乏认证和市场渠道。与研学营结合的农耕体验，是低门槛的增收路径。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="vein-society" style="display:none;" class="fade-in">
        <div class="vein-hero">
          <div class="vein-hero-eyebrow">大脉络 · 结构性问题</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-title">社会结构与人口</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-desc">村庄面临严重的人口结构失衡：老龄化率38%，青壮年外出务工率60%，留守儿童约25人。这一结构性问题是所有其他问题的底层背景。</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-meta">
            <div class="vein-hero-stat"><strong>24</strong>关联关键词</div>
            <div class="vein-hero-stat"><strong>38%</strong>老龄化率</div>
            <div class="vein-hero-stat"><strong>180人</strong>常住人口</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="color:var(--text3);font-size:11px;padding:20px 0;">子脉络内容加载中... <span style="color:var(--a1);">（点击展开各子脉络）</span></div>
      </div>

      <div id="vein-policy" style="display:none;" class="fade-in">
        <div class="vein-hero">
          <div class="vein-hero-eyebrow">大脉络 · 政策窗口</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-title">政策制度与治理</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-desc">非遗申报、返乡创业补贴、土地制度改革等政策窗口正在开放，是村庄发展的重要外部机遇。村委会治理能力是政策落地的关键变量。</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-meta">
            <div class="vein-hero-stat"><strong>19</strong>关联关键词</div>
            <div class="vein-hero-stat"><strong>3</strong>个政策窗口</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="color:var(--text3);font-size:11px;padding:20px 0;">子脉络内容加载中...</div>
      </div>

      <div id="vein-biz" style="display:none;" class="fade-in">
        <div class="vein-hero">
          <div class="vein-hero-eyebrow">大脉络 · 推演方向</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-title">业态可能性</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-desc">基于村庄资源禀赋与市场需求，推演出6个可能业态。山歌研学营（82%）是当前可行性最高的切入点，建议作为第一步。</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-meta">
            <div class="vein-hero-stat"><strong>6</strong>个推演业态</div>
            <div class="vein-hero-stat"><strong>82%</strong>最高可行性</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="color:var(--text3);font-size:11px;padding:20px 0;">子脉络内容加载中...</div>
      </div>

      <div id="vein-ecology" style="display:none;" class="fade-in">
        <div class="vein-hero">
          <div class="vein-hero-eyebrow">大脉络 · 资源禀赋</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-title">生态与空间资源</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-desc">山地地形、梯田景观、水资源是村庄的自然资本。生态保护与开发之间的张力需要在业态设计中谨慎处理。</div>
          <div class="vein-hero-meta">
            <div class="vein-hero-stat"><strong>12</strong>关联关键词</div>
            <div class="vein-hero-stat"><strong>280亩</strong>耕地总面积</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="color:var(--text3);font-size:11px;padding:20px 0;">子脉络内容加载中...</div>
      </div>

    </div><!-- /vein-detail -->
  </div><!-- /vein-layout -->
</div><!-- /page-vein -->


