                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                      <div class="process-item-icon on"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"/><rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="process-item-label">视频内容提取</div>
                      <button class="process-item-toggle on" onclick="toggleProcess(this)"></button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                      <div class="process-item-icon on"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="process-item-label">关键词自动提取</div>
                      <button class="process-item-toggle on" onclick="toggleProcess(this)"></button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                      <div class="process-item-icon on"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="process-item-label">文档结构化解析</div>
                      <button class="process-item-toggle on" onclick="toggleProcess(this)"></button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="process-item">
                      <div class="process-item-icon off"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="process-item-label">图片内容识别</div>
                      <button class="process-item-toggle off" onclick="toggleProcess(this)"></button>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="process-card">
                    <div class="process-card-title">分析框架（Skill）</div>
                    <div class="skill-select-grid">
                      <label class="skill-select-item selected">
                        <input type="checkbox" checked>
                        <div>
                          <div class="skill-select-label">费孝通差序格局</div>
                          <div class="skill-select-sub">社会结构分析</div>
                        </div>
                      </label>
                      <label class="skill-select-item selected">
                        <input type="checkbox" checked>
                        <div>
                          <div class="skill-select-label">乡村运营 SOP</div>
                          <div class="skill-select-sub">运营评估框架</div>
                        </div>
                      </label>
                      <label class="skill-select-item selected">
                        <input type="checkbox" checked>
                        <div>
                          <div class="skill-select-label">项飙·附近的消失</div>
                          <div class="skill-select-sub">社区关系分析</div>
                        </div>
                      </label>
                      <label class="skill-select-item">
                        <input type="checkbox">
                        <div>
                          <div class="skill-select-label">商业可行性分析</div>
                          <div class="skill-select-sub">业态评估框架</div>
                        </div>
                      </label>
                      <label class="skill-select-item">
                        <input type="checkbox">
                        <div>
                          <div class="skill-select-label">文化资产盘点</div>
                          <div class="skill-select-sub">非遗评估框架</div>
                        </div>
                      </label>
                      <label class="skill-select-item">
                        <input type="checkbox">
                        <div>
                          <div class="skill-select-label">风险识别矩阵</div>
                          <div class="skill-select-sub">风险评估框架</div>
                        </div>
                      </label>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="process-estimate">
                  <div class="process-estimate-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="process-estimate-text">
                    <div class="process-estimate-title">预计处理时间：约 8–12 分钟</div>
                    <div class="process-estimate-sub">3 个文件 · 音频转录 + 关键词提取 + 3 个 Skill 分析 · 处理期间可关闭窗口，完成后通知</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:24px;gap:8px;align-items:center;">
                  <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="goStep(2)">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"/></svg>
                    上一步
                  </button>
                  <button class="btn btn-success btn-lg" onclick="goStep(4)">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"/></svg>
                    开始 AI 处理
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 步骤4：处理中 -->
            <div class="step-panel" id="step-4">
              <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:28px 32px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);">
                <div class="processing-wrap">
                  <div class="processing-anim">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="processing-title">AI 正在处理你的田野资料</div>
                  <div class="processing-sub">请稍候，处理完成后将自动跳转到项目主页</div>

                  <div class="processing-tasks">
                    <div class="processing-task">
                      <div class="processing-task-icon done"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="processing-task-label">文件上传与校验</div>
                      <div class="processing-task-status done">完成</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="processing-task">
                      <div class="processing-task-icon done"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="processing-task-label">音频转录（传承人访谈）</div>
                      <div class="processing-task-status done">完成</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="processing-task">
                      <div class="processing-task-icon running"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="processing-task-label">关键词提取与分类</div>
                      <div class="processing-task-status running" id="running-status">处理中...</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="processing-task">
                      <div class="processing-task-icon pending"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="processing-task-label">费孝通差序格局分析</div>
                      <div class="processing-task-status pending">等待中</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="processing-task">
                      <div class="processing-task-icon pending"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="processing-task-label">乡村运营 SOP 评估</div>
                      <div class="processing-task-status pending">等待中</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="processing-task">
                      <div class="processing-task-icon pending"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/></svg></div>
                      <div class="processing-task-label">生成三层报告框架</div>
                      <div class="processing-task-status pending">等待中</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="processing-bar-wrap">
                    <div class="processing-bar"><div class="processing-bar-fill" id="proc-bar" style="width:38%"></div></div>
                    <div class="processing-pct" id="proc-pct">38%</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;">
                  <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="showToast('处理将在后台继续，完成后通知你','info')">最小化到后台</button>
                  <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="openConfirmModal('cancel-process')">取消处理</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 步骤5：完成 -->
            <div class="step-panel" id="step-5">
              <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:48px 32px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);text-align:center;">
                <div style="width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a2-dim2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 20px;box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(159,172,36,.3);">
                  <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B7A1A" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;">项目创建成功！</div>
                <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:32px;">贵州布依族山歌传承调研 已就绪，共处理 3 份资料，提取 47 个关键词</div>
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;max-width:480px;margin:0 auto 32px;">
                  <div style="background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;text-align:center;">
                    <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:var(--a1);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">3</div>
                    <div style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-top:2px;">已处理资料</div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;text-align:center;">
                    <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:var(--a2);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">47</div>
                    <div style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-top:2px;">关键词</div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;text-align:center;">
                    <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:var(--a5);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">3</div>
                    <div style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-top:2px;">Skill 激活</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px;">
                  <button class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" onclick="showToast('跳转到材料库...','info')">查看材料库</button>
                  <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" onclick="showPage('import',document.querySelector('.sb-item[onclick*=import]'));showToast('✅ 项目创建成功，请上传资料','success')">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
                    完成并开始导入资料
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div><!-- /onboard-wrap -->
        </div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
     PAGE: Agent记忆管理
══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="page-section" id="page-agent-memory">
  <div class="section">
    <!-- 页头 -->
    <div class="section-hd">
      <div>
        <div class="section-title"><span class="section-dot"></span>Agent 记忆管理</div>
        <div class="section-sub">82条记忆 · 最后更新 15分钟前</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
        <button class="btn btn-outline">导出记忆</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"/><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"/></svg>
          添加记忆
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 统计卡片 -->
    <div class="g5" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-val">82</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">记忆总数</div>
        <div class="kpi-delta">本周 +12</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card" style="--kpi-color:var(--a1);">
        <div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--a1);">34</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">事实记忆</div>
        <div class="kpi-delta">最多类型</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card green">
        <div class="kpi-val green">28</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">模式记忆</div>
        <div class="kpi-delta">分析结果</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card sky">
        <div class="kpi-val sky">15</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">推断记忆</div>
        <div class="kpi-delta">AI生成</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card sand">
        <div class="kpi-val sand">5</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">待验证</div>
        <div class="kpi-delta">需确认</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 左右分栏：分类树 + 记忆列表 -->
    <div class="g75">

      <!-- 左侧：记忆分类 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-hd">
          <div class="card-title">
            <div class="card-icon a1">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 19a2 2 0 01-2 2H4a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 012 2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            记忆分类
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body" style="padding:10px 12px;">

          <!-- 全部记忆 -->
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--a1-dim2);color:var(--a1);cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--border2);">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:14px;height:14px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;flex-shrink:0;"><path d="M22 19a2 2 0 01-2 2H4a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 012 2z"/></svg>
              <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;">全部记忆</span>
              <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">82</span>
            </div>

            <!-- 按类型分类 -->
            <div style="margin-top:10px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
              <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">记忆类型</div>
              <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;">
                  <div style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a1);flex-shrink:0;"></div>
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">事实记忆</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">34</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;">
                  <div style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a2);flex-shrink:0;"></div>
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">模式记忆</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">28</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;">
                  <div style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a5);flex-shrink:0;"></div>
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">推断记忆</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">15</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;">
                  <div style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a3);flex-shrink:0;"></div>
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">情境记忆</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">5</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 按状态分类 -->
            <div style="margin-top:14px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
              <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">记忆状态</div>
              <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;">
                  <div style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a2);flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 5px var(--a2);"></div>
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">已确认</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">77</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;">
                  <div style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--text3);flex-shrink:0;"></div>
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">待验证</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">5</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 按主题分类 -->
            <div style="margin-top:14px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
              <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">主题分类</div>
              <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;">
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">文化传承</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">28</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;">
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">经济发展</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">22</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;">
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">社会结构</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">18</span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface2);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;">
                  <span style="flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;">其他</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text4);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">14</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 右侧：记忆列表 -->
      <div>
        <!-- 搜索栏 -->
        <div style="position:relative;margin-bottom:12px;">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="position:absolute;left:12px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:14px;height:14px;stroke:var(--text4);fill:none;stroke-width:2;pointer-events:none;"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
          <input type="text" placeholder="搜索记忆内容..." style="width:100%;padding:9px 12px 9px 36px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;background:var(--surface);outline:none;">
        </div>

        <!-- 记忆卡片列表 -->
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;">

          <!-- 记忆卡片 1 -->
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body" style="padding:14px 16px;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;">
                  <div style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a1);flex-shrink:0;"></div>
                  <span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">事实记忆</span>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text3);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">2024-03-20 14:32</span>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px;">传承人平均年龄为68岁，处于高龄状态</div>
              <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:10px;">根据对12位传承人的访谈统计，布依族山歌传承人平均年龄68岁，最年轻的53岁，最年长的82岁。其中70岁以上占比58%。</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a1-dim2);color:var(--a1);">布依族山歌</span>
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a2-dim2);color:#6B7A1A;">传承人</span>
                <div style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;">
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text3);">来源：访谈材料</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a2-dim2);color:#6B7A1A;">已确认</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 记忆卡片 2 -->
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body" style="padding:14px 16px;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;">
                  <div style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a2);flex-shrink:0;"></div>
                  <span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">模式记忆</span>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text3);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">2024-03-19 10:22</span>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px;">年轻人外出务工与文化传承形成负向关联</div>
              <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:10px;">分析发现，外出务工率与文化传承活动参与度呈现负相关（r=-0.73）。务工率超过60%的村庄，传统节庆参与率下降至不足30%。</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a1-dim2);color:var(--a1);">外出务工</span>
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a2-dim2);color:#6B7A1A;">文化传承</span>
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a3-dim);color:var(--text2);">负向关联</span>
                <div style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;">
                  <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text3);">来源：AI分析</span>
                  <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a2-dim2);color:#6B7A1A;">已确认</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 记忆卡片 3 -->
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body" style="padding:14px 16px;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;">
                  <div style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a5);flex-shrink:0;"></div>
                  <span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">推断记忆</span>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text3);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">2024-03-18 16:48</span>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px;">若不干预，10年内山歌传承人将降至5人以下</div>
              <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:10px;">基于当前传承人年龄结构和年轻人参与率，模型推断：如无有效干预措施，10年内传承人数量将从12人降至不足5人，面临失传风险。</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a1-dim2);color:var(--a1);">布依族山歌</span>
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a2-dim2);color:#6B7A1A;">传承危机</span>
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a3-dim);color:var(--text2);">预测</span>
