                  <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a2-dim2);color:#6B7A1A;">已确认</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 记忆卡片 5 -->
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body" style="padding:14px 16px;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;">
                  <div style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a3);flex-shrink:0;"></div>
                  <span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">情境记忆</span>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text3);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">2024-03-16 09:30</span>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px;">2024年六月六节庆现场气氛热烈但参与者以老年人为主</div>
              <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:10px;">现场记录显示山歌对唱环节持续3小时，参与对唱的8位老人年龄均在65岁以上。年轻人多为旁观或拍照，未见主动参与对唱者。</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a1-dim2);color:var(--a1);">六月六</span>
                <span style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--a2-dim2);color:#6B7A1A;">现场观察</span>
                <div style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;">
