              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="workflow-card-body">
              <div class="workflow-steps">
                <div class="workflow-step">
                  <div class="workflow-step-num">1</div>
                  <div class="workflow-step-body">
                    <div class="workflow-step-title">在地资源盘点</div>
                    <div class="workflow-step-desc">识别村落独特资源：自然、文化、人力、产业基础</div>
                    <span class="workflow-step-tool">在地业态分析</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="workflow-step">
                  <div class="workflow-step-num">2</div>
                  <div class="workflow-step-body">
                    <div class="workflow-step-title">可行性评分</div>
                    <div class="workflow-step-desc">按市场需求、执行难度、社区接受度三维度评分</div>
                    <span class="workflow-step-tool">可视化看板</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="workflow-step">
                  <div class="workflow-step-num">3</div>
                  <div class="workflow-step-body">
                    <div class="workflow-step-title">孵化路径设计</div>
                    <div class="workflow-step-desc">制定6-12个月孵化计划，识别关键里程碑</div>
                    <span class="workflow-step-tool">三层报告 · 三度推演</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="workflow-step">
                  <div class="workflow-step-num">4</div>
                  <div class="workflow-step-body">
                    <div class="workflow-step-title">报告输出</div>
                    <div class="workflow-step-desc">生成可交付给基金会的正式评估报告</div>
                    <span class="workflow-step-tool">三层报告页</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="showToast('开始执行工作流','success')">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"/></svg>
                  执行
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="showToast('工作流已复制','success')">复制</button>
                <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="showToast('编辑工作流','info')">编辑</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="workflow-card" data-type="report">
            <div class="workflow-card-hd" onclick="this.closest('.workflow-card').classList.toggle('open')">
              <div class="workflow-card-icon sand">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="workflow-card-meta">
                <div class="workflow-card-name">快速报告生成流程</div>
                <div class="workflow-card-desc">从关键词到完整报告的快速通道 · 2步 · 已用12次</div>
              </div>
              <div class="workflow-card-badges">
                <span class="tag tag-sand">报告生成</span>
                <span class="tag tag-green">高频使用</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="workflow-card-body">
              <div class="workflow-steps">
                <div class="workflow-step">
                  <div class="workflow-step-num">1</div>
                  <div class="workflow-step-body">
                    <div class="workflow-step-title">关键词确认</div>
                    <div class="workflow-step-desc">确认核心关键词集合，选择分析框架</div>
                    <span class="workflow-step-tool">关键词引擎</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="workflow-step">
                  <div class="workflow-step-num">2</div>
                  <div class="workflow-step-body">
                    <div class="workflow-step-title">一键生成三层报告</div>
                    <div class="workflow-step-desc">AI自动生成一度→二度→三度报告，支持HTML导出</div>
                    <span class="workflow-step-tool">三层报告页</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="showToast('开始执行工作流','success')">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"/></svg>
                  执行
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="showToast('工作流已复制','success')">复制</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div><!-- /workflow-left -->

        <!-- 右侧：统计 + 进化记录 -->
        <div class="workflow-right">
